        <argsstring></argsstring>
        <name>lv_draw_label_hint_t</name>
        <briefdescription>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Store some info to speed up drawing of very large texts It takes a lot of time to get the first visible character because all the previous characters needs to be checked to calculate the positions. This structure stores an earlier (e.g. at -1000 px) coordinate and the index of that line. Therefore the calculations can start from here. </para>
        </detaileddescription>
